				1578,
				7
			],
			"Message": "style(Mountain): Normalize dispatcher indentation; update Cargo/tauri build identifiers\n\nRe-indent the extracted GenericNotification/Dispatcher and GenericRequest/Dispatcher files to remove the spurious extra block indentation level that was carried over from their original inline positions in CocoonService/mod.rs. Reorder imports (std before third-party) and collapse import brace formatting. No logic changes in either dispatcher.\n\nUpdate Cargo.toml binary/lib/package names and tauri.conf.json identifier/productName to the verbose build configuration string for the development/debug Electron profile, distinguishing this build artifact from production Mountain releases. Preserve originals as .Backup copies.\n\nOutcome: dispatcher code now matches project style conventions, and the development build artifact is correctly labelled for toolchain identification.",
			"SHA": "e78bf315d71ba4a49c4200d7f7002d24f6058255"
		}
	],
